{
  "schema": "palsync/goal-oracle/1",
  "scenario": "01_equipment_checkout",
  "note": "Evaluator-owned. Never copy into a run workspace. Each exercise check is self-contained: it creates its own {{runId}} records. Calibrate against a known-good build before scoring (README). A check with variants passes when any variant passes: a goal leaves the UI shape to the model.",
  "workflow": "console",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "C1_add",
      "goal": 1,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "steps": [
        {
          "click": "Add equipment",
          "expect": [
            "Name",
            "Category",
            "Notes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fill": {
            "name": "Laptop {{runId}}",
            "category": "Laptop"
          },
          "click": "Save",
          "expect": [
            "Laptop {{runId}}"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C2_name_required",
      "goal": 2,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "steps": [
        {
          "click": "Add equipment"
        },
        {
          "fill": {
            "name": "",
            "category": "Ghost"
          },
          "click": "Save",
          "expect": [
            "Name is required."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C3_checkout",
      "goal": 3,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "variants": [
        {
          "name": "form",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Camera {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Camera {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "click": "Check out",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Camera {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": "Pat {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Camera {{runId}}",
                "Pat {{runId}}",
                "Checked out to"
              ],
              "within": "a:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr a), button:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr button)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "row",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Camera {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Camera {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": "Pat {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Camera {{runId}}",
                "Pat {{runId}}",
                "Checked out to"
              ],
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Camera {{runId}}\")"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C4_assignee_required",
      "goal": 4,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "variants": [
        {
          "name": "form",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Projector {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Projector {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "click": "Check out",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Projector {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": ""
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Enter a name to check this item out."
              ],
              "within": "a:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr a), button:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr button)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "row",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Projector {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Projector {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": ""
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Enter a name to check this item out."
              ],
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Projector {{runId}}\")"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C5_checkin",
      "goal": 5,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "variants": [
        {
          "name": "form",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Tripod {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Tripod {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "click": "Check out",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Tripod {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": "Sam {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Sam {{runId}}"
              ],
              "within": "a:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr a), button:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr button)"
            },
            {
              "click": "Check in",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Tripod {{runId}}\")",
              "expect": [
                "Tripod {{runId}}"
              ],
              "absent": [
                "Sam {{runId}}"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "row",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Tripod {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Tripod {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": "Sam {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Sam {{runId}}"
              ],
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Tripod {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "click": "Check in",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Tripod {{runId}}\")",
              "expect": [
                "Tripod {{runId}}"
              ],
              "absent": [
                "Sam {{runId}}"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C6_edit_keeps_checkout",
      "goal": 6,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "variants": [
        {
          "name": "form",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Old {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Old {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "click": "Check out",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Old {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": "Lee {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Lee {{runId}}"
              ],
              "within": "a:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr a), button:text-is(\"Check out\"):not(tr button)"
            },
            {
              "click": "Edit",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Old {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "New {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "New {{runId}}",
                "Lee {{runId}}"
              ],
              "absent": [
                "Old {{runId}}"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "row",
          "steps": [
            {
              "click": "Add equipment"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "Old {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "Old {{runId}}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "checkedOutTo": "Lee {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Check out",
              "expect": [
                "Lee {{runId}}"
              ],
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Old {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "click": "Edit",
              "within": "tr:has-text(\"Old {{runId}}\")"
            },
            {
              "fill": {
                "name": "New {{runId}}"
              },
              "click": "Save",
              "expect": [
                "New {{runId}}",
                "Lee {{runId}}"
              ],
              "absent": [
                "Old {{runId}}"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C7_delete",
      "goal": 7,
      "kind": "exercise",
      "expectDialog": "Delete this item? This cannot be undone.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "click": "Add equipment"
        },
        {
          "fill": {
            "name": "Doomed {{runId}}"
          },
          "click": "Save",
          "expect": [
            "Doomed {{runId}}"
          ]
        },
        {
          "click": "Delete",
          "within": "tr:has-text(\"Doomed {{runId}}\")",
          "absent": [
            "Doomed {{runId}}"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "C8_empty_state",
      "goal": 8,
      "kind": "source-contains",
      "text": "No equipment yet. Add your first item to get started.",
      "why": "The shared eval pal holds rows from other checks, so the empty list cannot be exercised live; require the exact copy in pal source."
    },
    {
      "id": "C9a_validate",
      "goal": 9,
      "kind": "validate",
      "maxErrors": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "C9b_compile",
      "goal": 9,
      "kind": "test",
      "workflow": "console",
      "maxNotes": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "C9c_visual",
      "goal": 9,
      "kind": "human",
      "rubric": "Score desktop + mobile screenshots of the list, add form, and checkout form 0-2 on: clear focal point/primary action, spacing, typography hierarchy, alignment, state clarity (checked out vs available), responsive layout (no mobile horizontal overflow). Record the average."
    }
  ],
  "limits": [
    "C2 checks the message only; it cannot prove that no row was written, because the GOAL does not fix a visible column for the filled category.",
    "C3 cannot assert row-scoped 'not available'; C5 covers the status round trip.",
    "The checkout-form submit is scoped to the clickable \"Check out\" link or button outside table rows, because a valid form may also carry a \"Check out\" heading (calibration 2026-11-10, run goal01_C1).",
    "C3-C6 accept two UI shapes: a separate checkout form, or a checkedOutTo field inside the row (calibration 2026-11-10, run goal01_C2). Other valid shapes (e.g. a modal) still need a new variant."
  ]
}
